WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.963
Eddy raced.

2
00:00:10.964 --> 00:00:15.168
Most cars flew ahead of Eddy.

3
00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:19.594
But some cars were behind him.

4
00:00:19.595 --> 00:00:33.287
"At least I'm not last," Eddy thought.

5
00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:38.988
Then Eddy passed a car.

6
00:00:38.989 --> 00:00:42.540
"Cool!" said Eddy.

7
00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:47.638
Vroom! Eddy picked up speed.

8
00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:55.157
He went around the bend.

9
00:00:55.158 --> 00:01:03.392
Eddy passed another car.

10
00:01:03.393 --> 00:01:06.824
Then he passed another.

11
00:01:06.825 --> 00:01:09.583
"Wow!" said Eddy.

12
00:01:09.584 --> 00:01:17.476
"I really am fast!

13
00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:26.675
I'm going to make the team!"

14
00:01:26.676 --> 00:01:39.896
Eddy saw the finish line.

15
00:01:39.897 --> 00:01:49.345
He raced across it.

16
00:01:49.346 --> 00:01:52.999
"I won!" Zippy was shouting.

17
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.231
Eddy looked over.

18
00:01:55.232 --> 00:01:59.480
Three other cars were with Zippy.

19
00:01:59.481 --> 00:02:03.419
They all had team stickers.

20
00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:09.468
"The four winners," thought Eddy.

21
00:02:09.469 --> 00:02:13.191
"Sorry, Eddy," said Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:13.192 --> 00:02:16.045
"You were pretty fast.

23
00:02:16.046 --> 00:02:24.041
But you didn't make the team."

